        "name": "Lightslinger",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Whenever Lucian uses an ability, his next attack becomes a double-shot. When Lucian is healed or shielded by an ally, or when a nearby enemy Champion is immobilized, his next 2 basic attacks will deal bonus magic damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "After using an Ability, Lucian's next Attack within 3.5 seconds will fire two shots. The second shot deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> to the target, increased to <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% Attack Damage)</span> against minions.<br /><br /><span>Vigilance: </span>When Lucian is directly healed or shielded by an ally, or when a nearby enemy Champion is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilized</span>, his pistols become <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Overcharged</span> with energy, causing his next 2 basic attacks to deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15 + (20% Attack Damage)) magic damage</span>.",
