        "bodyHtml": "Lucian rapidly fires <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">?</span> shots in a direction for 3 seconds or until he <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasts</span>. Each shot deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15/30/45 + (25% Attack Damage) + (15% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> to the first enemy hit.<br /><br />While firing, Lucian may use <span>Relentless Pursuit</span>.<br /><br />Total Damage: <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15/30/45 + 25% Attack Damage + 15% Ability Power) physical damage</span><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Number of shots scales with Lucian's Critical Strike chance and Critical Strike damage at 100% effectiveness.<br />Deals 200% damage to minions.</span>",
